  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustain Lives of 15 Orphaned Children in Tigray.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The war in Tigray has orphaned countless children. Mebriata Children&apos;s Foundation aims to support 15 of these orphans for a year, providing essentials like food, clothing, shelter, medical care, and schooling. These children will reside with a responsible adult, ensuring proper fund utilization. Our goal is to permanently care for these children and, with enough support, expand our assistance to more children trapped in dire conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
